<view class="admin-page admin-secondary-page">
  <view class="admin-header">
    <view class="admin-title">{{ title }}</view>
    <view class="admin-subtitle">
      手动维护城市、区县、小区和中心点，保存后由区域 service 写入原有服务区域集合。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-status-card">
    <view class="admin-card-title">区域配置</view>
    <view class="admin-card-desc">
      页面仅维护手动配置字段；不新增自动定位、路径规划、实时轨迹或 ETA，当前能力边界为非实时轨迹、非 ETA。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{ errorText }}" class="admin-error-card">{{ errorText }}</view>

  <view class="admin-loading-wrap" wx:if="{{ loading }}">
    <loading-view text="正在加载区域"></loading-view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="admin-section-card">
      <view class="admin-section-title">基础信息</view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">城市</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          value="{{ form.city }}"
          data-field="city"
          bindinput="handleInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">区县</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          value="{{ form.district }}"
          data-field="district"
          bindinput="handleInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">街道</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          value="{{ form.street }}"
          data-field="street"
          bindinput="handleInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">小区</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          value="{{ form.community }}"
          data-field="community"
          bindinput="handleInput"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="admin-section-card">
      <view class="admin-section-title">配置说明</view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">中心点纬度</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          type="digit"
          value="{{ form.latitude }}"
          data-field="latitude"
          bindinput="handleInput"
          placeholder="例如 30.2741"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">中心点经度</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          type="digit"
          value="{{ form.longitude }}"
          data-field="longitude"
          bindinput="handleInput"
          placeholder="例如 120.1551"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">行政区编码</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          value="{{ form.adcode }}"
          data-field="adcode"
          bindinput="handleInput"
          placeholder="例如 330106"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">地图地址</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          value="{{ form.map_address }}"
          data-field="map_address"
          bindinput="handleInput"
          placeholder="地图选点后的标准地址"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="form-item">
        <text class="form-label">地图 POI</text>
        <input
          class="form-input"
          value="{{ form.map_poi_name }}"
          data-field="map_poi_name"
          bindinput="handleInput"
          placeholder="例如 小区东门"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="admin-section-card admin-status-card">
      <view class="admin-section-title">边界说明</view>
      <view class="admin-card-desc">
        区域命中、可服务范围和候选筛选以后端为准；本页不计算实时距离、不生成轨迹、不承诺 ETA。
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="admin-section-card admin-action-card">
      <view class="admin-section-title">管理操作</view>
      <button
        class="admin-action-button admin-full-button"
        loading="{{ saving }}"
        disabled="{{ saving }}"
        bindtap="handleSave"
      >
        保存服务区域
      </button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
